# ---- 3D character / animation assets ----
# Large binaries. Mixamo's license restricts redistributing the raw files, so they
# are not committed. The game auto-falls-back to a CC0 placeholder without them.
# See public/models/README.md to add your own. Delete these lines to commit assets.
/public/models/*.fbx
/public/models/*.glb
